{"id":"vod_md_6371","vodId":"6371","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"悠哉日常大王","name_cn":"悠哉日常大王","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231030-1/421d26905e217912c8e530751ac42d9b.jpg"},"summary":"在一个远离都市喧嚣、为青山绿水所环绕的乡村，当地的旭丘分校仅有四名学生。越谷家的兄妹三人，分别是中三的卓、中二的小鞠（阿澄佳奈 配音）和中一的越谷夏海（佐仓绫音 配音），另有宫内家的小女儿小一的莲华（小岩井ことり 配音）。莲华的姐姐一穗（名冢佳织 配音）是分校的唯一教师，因学生稀少，因此四人和在一个班，日常课程也全部以自习为主。在某个晴朗时节，正读五年级的东京女孩一条萤（村川梨衣 配音）因父母工作的关系搬到旭丘。对喧哗吵闹的都市节奏习以为常，风格迥异的乡村生活带给萤萤前所未有的新奇体验。虽然有着诸多不便，但在这个时间仿佛凝滞的所在，悠然自得的好心情慢慢升起……本片根据あっと的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-30 09:42:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/zeZOLTj4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/v8iM5Nta/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/3ZInAhUx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/LYYSptgg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/cYDSQeKF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/zWCaJSfj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/Prod1fE9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/8oNzXh7M/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/dqoY9WKB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/eZZ4S7L8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/JB4RPsWn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/BYkz4o1G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/p2uVnQnC/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:21.117Z"}